<title>FRANCE: Metaleurop raises zinc price to 6,240 Ffr.</title>
<headline>Metaleurop raises zinc price to 6,240 Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metaleurop SA said on Wednesday it raised its indicative zinc price to 6,240 francs per tonne, effective today.</p>
<p>The last change was to 5,990 francs per tonne on October 9.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
